warning[repeated-concat]: `result` is copied on every loop step
 --> positive.jl:5:9
  |
5 |         result = vcat(result, part)
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ builds new `result` from old one
  |
  = why: each step copies all earlier pieces, so total work grows with square of length
  = fix: `append!` or `push!` into `result`, or collect pieces and join once (`reduce(vcat, pieces)`)   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain repeated-concat
  = note: warn from performance group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow repeated-concat -- <reason>`

